# Generated / tool-owned files — never formatted, or the generator's output drifts vs a
# formatted copy (and the `changelog-owned` CI gate rejects changelog edits). See vite.config.ts.
**/*.generated.json
**/drizzle/meta/
# Traced hold silhouettes (#2202). `scripts/generate-board-art-geometry.ts` emits one
# polygon per line and `--check` byte-compares the result, so a formatting pass that
# reflows the coordinate arrays would put the drift gate permanently red — and it triples
# the file size for data nobody reads by eye. Nested dir, so the `**/generated/**` glob in
# vite.config.ts fmt.ignore is not enough on its own.
packages/shared/board-art-geometry/src/generated/

# Local-only board-data exports (gitignored, see .gitignore). If an operator drops an
# export here to run an importer, don't let `vp check` try to reformat the raw data.
packages/db/data/
# CHANGELOG.md is generated + owned by the mobile OTA pipeline (built from PR Release
# Notes); hand-formatting it drifts vs the generator and the `changelog-owned` gate
# rejects edits. It's in vite.config.ts fmt.ignore too, but the full-repo `vp check`
# only honours .prettierignore for by-name files.
CHANGELOG.md
# Embedded ESP32 firmware is a self-contained PlatformIO sub-project with its own
# .clang-format; its JS build scripts and Markdown aren't held to the web/mobile Prettier
# config (the CI PR-lint already skips `embedded/`).
embedded/
docs/embedded-architecture.md
# Maestro flow yamls are consumed by the Maestro CLI and asserted VERBATIM by
# scripts/__tests__/mobile-screenshots.test.ts (exact quote style included) —
# a formatting pass that rewrites quotes breaks those tests.
packages/mobile/.maestro/

# Markdown is not formatted. The formatter's emphasis pairing does not follow
# CommonMark's intraword-underscore rule: on docs/websocket-implementation.md it
# paired the `_` inside the bare identifier NOT_FOUND with a later `_signed-in_`
# and emitted NOT*FOUND + \_signed-in*, corrupting an identifier in prose on
# every run. Prose gains little from auto-formatting and has content the
# formatter can get wrong. Mirrored in vite.config.ts fmt.ignore.
# The CHANGELOG.md and docs/embedded-architecture.md entries above are now
# subsumed by this, but stay: they document why those two must never be
# formatted even if markdown formatting is ever reinstated.
*.md

# Vendored minified bundle. Already listed in vite.config.ts fmt.ignore as
# **/board-controller/**, but oxfmt 0.64 (vite-plus 0.3.0) started matching it
# through that glob anyway and rewrapped 263 lines of a 1.2 MB build artifact.
# Per the note in vite.config.ts, path forms the glob list misses are handled
# here reliably — this is one of them.
packages/web/board-controller/
